{
  "_comment": "Project-specific permission grants, merged into every dev repo's .claude/settings.json by scripts/cto/push-to-repos.sh (permissions.allow/deny/ask: union). Copy to .cto/settings-overlay.json in your CTO home. The public template names no project's MCP servers; yours go here, e.g. a code-graph engine or a browser driver. For codegram (the reference code-graph engine, not open source yet) the grants are mcp__codegram and mcp__codegram__<tool>; until it is open, put your own RAG / code-graph server here instead. List every MCP TOOL by name (mcp__<server>__<tool>): since Claude Code 2.1.299 a bare mcp__<server> rule covers none of its tools.",
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "mcp__your-code-graph-server__query",
      "mcp__your-code-graph-server__traverse"
    ]
  }
}
